# Exploratory work — not part of the reproducible analysis.
# The STRROD separation score ranks loci on the same statistics Figure 2 plots,
# so it is a tool for choosing exemplars rather than a result. Kept untracked
# on purpose; nothing in Analysis.Rmd depends on it.
exploratory/

# Intermediate figure-2 tracks are regenerated by the Analysis.Rmd bash chunk
analysis/figure2/*.focal.*
analysis/figure2/focal_bins.bed
analysis/figure2/regions.bed
analysis/figure2/focal_fst_persnp.txt

# NOTE: analysis/figure2/focal_loci.csv is deliberately NOT ignored — it is just
# six coordinates and committing it keeps the figure reproducible without the
# scorer. Add it here if you would rather it stayed local.
